// FS25 volumetric fog: froxel light scattering + integration (this is where god rays come from - sun light
// scattered by the fog, masked by the shadow volume). Decompiled with the state-machine control-flow mode; dx.op
// counts match the original. RenoDX (all default to the game):
//   Light Shafts - scales the sun's in-scattering only (not the ambient fog light), so shafts stand out.
//   Shaft Focus - pushes the fog's Mie phase asymmetry towards forward scattering (beams concentrate toward the sun).
//   Fog Density - scales height fog and ground fog density.
